                            <comment id="17930209" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Tue, 25 Feb 2025 09:29:11 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The V4 interface added filtering for `jobNames`, excluding the Scheduler lists for statistics hit counts, scheduled backups, and garbage cleanup.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The V2 interface does not have this filtering.&#160;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add the same filtering conditions as in the V4 interface.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
